WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.160
We chose a random gas station in Finland

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:03.160
and gave drivers

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:05.000
a full tank of free gas

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:06.200
If they could receive

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.200
a pro table tennis serve!

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:08.240
Watch until the end

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:09.560
to see how many could do it!

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:12.560
Three tries

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:14.440
How many liters do
you think it's gonna go?

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:15.000
50!

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:16.720
Well, that's like 100€

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:18.200
A price worth competing for!

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:18.840
Yeah.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:22.040
Ooh, second one.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:24.440
Ah!

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:28.400
Still a bit too much here.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.520
It was really curved!

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:34.280
Whoa, wow!

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:34.920
The wind is...

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:36.320
I don't know if it's on our side

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:37.560
or the people's side?

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:41.160
Ooh! It's not making things easier.

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:42.120
That's for sure.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:44.880
Good try!

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:46.520
Have you played table tennis before?

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:47.520
Sometimes!

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:53.560
OK. So the last serve

00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:54.680
will be with a chocolate racket

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:57.360
In honor of the 5 million subscribers challenge!

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:00.560
Which means building the world's
biggest chocolate rocket

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:01.800
and actually playing with it.

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:03.920
If we hit 5 million
by the end of the year.

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:06.120
Make sure you
subscribe to see this happen!

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:11.080
Ooh, that was close!

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:11.880
Thanks!

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:13.920
Thanks for the challenge.

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:14.600
Yeah, let's go!

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:23.720
The truck actually stopped!

00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:25.600
Just for one table tennis ball!

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:35.960
Oh man!

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:37.880
This guy knows how to play!

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:44.600
They have a cheering group over there!

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:48.600
Any final words?

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:49.440
It was a very good effort

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:50.440
Go stream my music!

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:51.440
"Santerivaa"

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:52.320
So I don't have to sell

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:53.560
gutters for my whole life!

00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:55.640
Can we hear a small sample of your music?

00:01:55.640 --> 00:01:56.360
Pongfinity

00:01:56.360 --> 00:01:57.360
Shout out to these guys!

00:01:57.360 --> 00:01:57.840
Let's go!

00:01:57.840 --> 00:01:59.680
🎵Tää vaatii tunteja, useita toistoja🎵

00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:01.280
🎵Ja vaalii euroja, upeita muistoja🎵

00:02:01.280 --> 00:02:02.440
🎵Tää tarvii tarpeeks vauhtii🎵

00:02:02.440 --> 00:02:04.640
🎵...🎵

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:05.920
NICE!!

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:07.920
Go and check it out!

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:10.560
So this was Finnish water construction team

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:11.760
No success this time

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:12.720
But good efforts!

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:13.220
*Laughter*

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:15.440
Our opponent gets to choose

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:16.800
whoever of us

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:17.680
serves to her!

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:20.000
Who looks like they have the easiest serve?

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:27.800
Okay...
No offense Emil!

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:31.560
You hit it!

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:32.200
That's good.

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:36.600
Ace!

00:02:38.360 --> 00:02:39.000
Alright!

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:42.440
Ooh!

00:02:42.440 --> 00:02:44.400
Could I get a wind discount on that one?

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:48.800
Oooohh!!

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:49.480
He got it!!

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:50.920
Did you see the curve!

00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:53.040
Well done!!

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:53.640
Nice!

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:55.560
The arc was like beautiful

00:02:55.560 --> 00:02:57.240
The wind was coming

00:02:58.560 --> 00:02:59.600
Regards to Kliffa!

00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:00.920
So: Hey to Kliffa!

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:02.280
All right, go for it!

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:03.920
So the tank is almost empty

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:06.560
So he gets full benefit of this challenge!

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:07.640
Just under 100 Euros

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:08.960
It's big money for me!

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:09.680
For everybody yeah!

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:11.360
My Monday is a happy day!

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:12.600
Awesome! That's good to hear.

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:13.360
Thank you guys!

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:15.280
First person to receive the serve!

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:16.200
He was a happy guy.

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:18.000
He said his Monday is a happy Monday now.

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:19.360
That's always nice to hear!

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:20.400
Yeah, that's nice!

00:03:20.520 --> 00:03:21.440
I see a car coming!

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:23.960
So the next challenger

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:24.840
Do you...?

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:25.600
Free gas?

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:26.720
Yeah.. no!

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:27.600
Next!

00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:29.120
Is there a challenge here?

00:03:29.240 --> 00:03:30.560
No Emil! Get out!

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:32.240
We need more challengers!

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:33.960
You up for the challenge?

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:34.840
Yes, of course!

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:35.520
That's great!

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:37.320
I have my own table at home!

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:40.360
Good try!

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:41.320
That was a good try.

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:44.720
He's coming in with force!

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:45.560
Last chance!

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:51.360
That was so close!

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:53.320
This close!

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:54.560
All right. Thanks.

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:55.160
Thanks.

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:56.480
There's mental support!

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:05.280
Calculating the spin

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:06.360
I'm trying, yeah!

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:18.360
Oooh, good tries!

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:20.120
Oh, they have an electric car!

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:21.800
We will pay the electricity.

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:23.520
And if you don't get the serve on

00:04:23.520 --> 00:04:24.560
You have to give us Red Bull?

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:27.040
Lassi you should be the one serving!

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:27.720
Ok Lassi!

00:04:27.720 --> 00:04:28.400
We trust you.

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:29.360
We want some Red Bull.

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:31.680
So if you win, we get nothing?

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:32.640
I don't know...?

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:38.440
Lassi!

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:41.280
Can we have one each for sympathy?

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:42.240
Of course you can!

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:44.240
Normal or zero?

00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:45.600
The zero one!

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:48.200
because that's how I feel about myself.

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:51.120
Okay

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:53.240
Do you still wanna try
some of our serves?

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:56.520
Almost!

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:03.960
Oooh!

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:05.560
They got it!

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:08.920
Oh, there's this military guy.

00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:09.920
Should we ask them?

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:11.800
Today's main exercise!

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:12.400
Over!

00:05:12.920 --> 00:05:13.480
Under!

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:24.280
Oooh almost with the finger!

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:27.680
Good try!

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:35.840
Backhand smash!

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:37.920
Oh, pen hold!

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:42.400
Good tries though!

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:48.080
Oooooh!!

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:50.000
That was it!

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:52.520
Nice one, good job!

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:54.560
Oh lefty!
- Let's go!

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:57.240
Lefties are really good at receiving serves!

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:03.920
There was some spin on that ball!

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:09.680
And that ball is lost forever!

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:11.080
Noooo!!

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:12.600
He ran over the ball!

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:17.320
We have now tested the Pongfinity balls...

00:06:17.720 --> 00:06:20.120
They cannot handle a truck

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:21.600
which is surprising...

00:06:21.600 --> 00:06:22.240
Thank you.

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:24.480
So to spice things up

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:26.280
we're going to move on to bigger tanks!

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:27.600
Do you speak English?

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:29.840
No English. Polish!

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:32.200
How big is the tank?

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:33.240
600 liters.

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:35.360
You want to do the serve challenge?

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:36.400
Nawww!

00:06:36.400 --> 00:06:37.600
That's good for us!

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:39.760
So let's find our next victim

00:06:39.760 --> 00:06:42.040
from the regular car section!

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:43.480
She's scared

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:45.120
She's up for the challenge!

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:47.000
She's thrilled to join us.

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:49.640
Ok, are you ready for the challenge?

00:06:49.640 --> 00:06:50.680
Oh, yes.

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:51.840
Here's the racket.

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:53.320
Have you played table tennis before?

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:55.200
Yes.

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:58.880
Ooohhhh she got it first try!!

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:00.760
And there's no reaction!

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:04.040
Congrats!

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:05.160
That's amazing!

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:06.000
Thanks!

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:08.080
I think that's the first person ever

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:09.520
to return the first serve!

00:07:09.520 --> 00:07:11.000
Filling up Milja's car.

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:12.560
40 liters of free gas!

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:13.920
Thank you!

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:15.880
You saw the beard?

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:16.800
I'm a bit envious!

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:18.240
I think you have to do the serve

00:07:18.240 --> 00:07:20.040
So we have the battle of the beards!

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:21.520
Go easy on me!

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:30.200
Last one

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:33.840
Thank you!

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:42.680
So the last one 

00:07:42.680 --> 00:07:44.080
With a chocolate racket

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:48.040
Like that!

00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:52.240
46 liters and 101 Euros!

00:07:52.520 --> 00:07:53.720
Always try!

00:07:53.720 --> 00:07:54.680
Even if not knowing how to!

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:55.640
Wise words!

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:58.040
You always have to try,
even though you don't know how to.

